        }
      }
    },
    "TREATMENT": {
      "present": true,
      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Mildly affected patients may not require intervention and can be kept in a low-stimu-",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "latory, protective environment.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Treatment is focused on decontamination and supportive care. Induce emesis following recent (<2 hours) ingestion in asymptomatic patients if they have not already vomited. If symptomatic, gastric lavage should be considered for large ingestions or if concentrated products",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "were ingested.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Activated charcoal q8h for 2–3 doses if severe signs.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Warming/cooling measures as needed.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "IV fluid support if poor perfusion parameters or",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "dehydration.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Oxygen if respiratory",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "depression.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Provide ocular lubricant and rotation to comatose animals.",
          "pdf_page": 951,
          "printed_page": 869,
          "column": 2
        }
      ],
